1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:13,980
Sarah, James, let me ask you both a serious question: if you hired a world-class executive assistant, would you make them stand behind your chair all day, waiting for you to type every word into their ear?

2
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,596
Absolutely not, Professor!

3
00:00:16,596 --> 00:00:26,830
An executive assistant should be proactively managing the schedule, triaging urgent emails, and preparing briefings while you focus on high-level strategy!

4
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:32,767
But Professor, that is exactly what millions of developers are doing right now!

5
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:41,184
They open ChatGPT or Claude in a browser tab, type a prompt, wait 20 seconds, copy-paste the output, and repeat that 50 times a day!

6
00:00:41,184 --> 00:00:44,310
They are acting as the assistant to their own AI!

7
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:47,206
Haha, you're so right, James!

8
00:00:47,206 --> 00:00:50,717
They are trapped in the interactive chat box model.

9
00:00:50,717 --> 00:00:57,880
But when you ask them to run an autonomous agent, they get terrified of runaway bills or broken servers!

10
00:00:58,780 --> 00:00:59,980
Exactly!

11
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:11,190
They ask: "James, if I let an AI agent run in the background while I sleep, what if it goes into an infinite loop, spams 10,000 emails, or spends $5,000 on my credit card?"

12
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:19,061
And those fears are completely valid—IF you don't know distributed systems architecture.

13
00:01:19,061 --> 00:01:27,380
Welcome, global students, to Session 2 on Slide 1: "24/7 Sleep-Free Guardian: Gemini Spark Architecture!"

14
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:39,060
In this session, we teach you how to build a rock-solid, persistent cloud guardian that never sleeps, never crashes, and operates strictly within cryptographic safety boundaries!

15
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:49,780
Under our motto 'SOLI DEO GLORIA—To God Alone Be the Glory,' let us open Part 1 on Slide 2 and liberate human time!

